WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.770
Provincial Military Commander Li was framed by
the Dark Cooking Society and was sent into prison.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.350
To save him,

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.400
we sneaked into the Forbidden City,

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.920
and accidentally broke into the swearing-in ceremony

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.370
of the new chef of the royal kitchen.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:46.930
We found that the person

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:49.270
who intended to take the place of

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.390
the best chef of the Chinese Cooking Society was Fei.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:53.990
So we decided to

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.300
compete with Fei and the two Chefs

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:57.500
in front of the Emperor.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:04.030
Secret Plan of Fei the Genius!
New Man-Han Imperial Feast

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.580
I wonder what kind of dishes they will make.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:11.640
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.320
I wonder if they will let us taste the dishes.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:15.910
They are required to cook one hundred dishes,

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.210
which means they will make one hundred kinds of food.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.320
And they only have three hours.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.980
It's almost a mission impossible.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.900
The Hundred-Dish Royal Cooking Competition

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.860
can basically decide

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.730
who is the best chef in China.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:31.470
Of course, it's difficult.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.090
It seems that we made the right decision

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.730
to come here from Guangzhou to watch this.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:41.540
My gosh.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.310
I can’t believe you are still in
the mood for drinking, old man.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.570
Do you plan to cook the Man-Han Banquet
for the competition?

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.600
Yes.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.990
It is the top royal dish evolved

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.760
through the four-thousand-year Chinese history.

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:57.430
In the past, only Emperors were qualified to eat it.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.100
It is also the most luxurious dish in the world.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.720
But the cooking method of the Man-Han Banquet

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.120
has only been passed down

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:06.190
in the royal kitchen.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.030
Its recipe

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.330
has never been made public.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.650
There is no dish

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:11.900
that we can't cook.

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:13.920
I don't agree to cook the Man-Han Banquet.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:14.810
Lai He.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.140
Think about it.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:17.560
He is the Emperor.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:18.580
He must have had the Man-Han Banquet

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.140
for thousands of times.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.530
How could you not think of that?

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.560
We never should have let him be our leader.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.940
You said that we need his talent.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:31.950
Remember?

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.470
I know that.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.480
Anyway, our goal is to win, right?

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.150
So let me handle

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.400
the one hundred dishes.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.620
Hands off.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:47.940
What?

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.790
The Man-Han Banquet I'm about to make

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.120
is beyond your imagination.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:54.300
What?

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:01.790
What is that?

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.740
What is he doing?

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.300
Fei.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.360
Is this the list of dishes of the Man-Han Banquet?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.470
I've never seen

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:30.590
(Feel the poetry of the food)
this kind of Man-Han Banquet.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.320
I will be the leader of the group.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:38.790
Are there any different ideas?

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.220
When will you stop thinking and start doing?

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.300
What is wrong with you?

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.150
The Emperor wants us to make

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.770
one hundred delicious dishes.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.680
But what kind of dishes are delicious

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.510
for the Emperor?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:10.520
You can never have the correct answer

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:12.340
to this question.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.430
Anyway, we need to cook one hundred dishes.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.870
I can't wait anymore.

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:18.020
We can never cook good dishes

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.370
as long as we have doubts.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.390
Trust him.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.040
Lei En, why are you defending him?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.680
Don't forget. Time waits for no one.

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.100
If we lose the competition,

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.080
we will never be able to cook.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:31.270
Is that what you want?

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.000
What's wrong with Mao?

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:41.120
He is sitting there doing nothing

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.380
just as he did at the Tofu Competition.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:51.470
Fry the vegetable first.

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:52.950
Be careful about the degree of the fire.

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:54.390
Prepare the fish.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:57.620
About the beef, only use the tenderloin
at the shoulder area.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.490
And get rid of the other parts.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.870
Look! He's amazing.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.040
Lai He is in charge of the pot.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.970
Yang Shi is in charge of the knife.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.450
And the group leader is

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.650
Genius Fei.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.660
With extraordinary expertise,

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:24.370
the group has won

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.450
the Peking Cooking Competition.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.960
What is wrong with Mao's group?

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.090
Start cooking, Mao!

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:35.420
Right.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.830
If they use the legendary cook wares...

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.320
Mind your own business.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:41.800
Only if they beat the Dark Cooking Society

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.440
with their own strength,

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.000
the competition is meaningful.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:48.340
I believe they will win.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.280
Lei En, get out of the way.

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.130
If we keep waiting,

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.510
it'll be getting dark.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.180
Maybe Chef Xie is right.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.770
I can never know

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.760
what dishes are delicious

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.360
for the Emperor.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.000
What would mother do

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.780
if she were in my position?

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:53.880
His hands are thin.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.130
And he often yawns.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.220
His skin is not glossy.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:00.140
Chef Xie. Lei En.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:01.750
Have you decided on the dishes?

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:02.360
What do you plan to cook?

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:03.930
The theme is...

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:04.870
The theme?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.120
Okay, listen.

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.870
I see.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.640
It's a great idea.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.670
You are a genius.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:14.720
See? I was right.

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.730
It's the right thing to do to believe Mao and be patient.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.450
Yeah.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:19.510
Okay.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:20.260
Now, to make up

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.240
for the time we wasted,

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:23.370
Chef Xie and I will do the preparation work.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.290
You are

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.530
in charge of the pot.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.360
Don't hesitate to give us orders.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.430
We'll do whatever you tell us to do.

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.420
Wait. Chef Xie. Lei En.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:35.660
Time is important indeed.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:36.890
But I think each of us

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:39.280
should cook the dishes we are good at

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.940
and try to cook one hundred dishes.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.040
Does that sound good?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.130
The dishes we are good at.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.380
Why are you so nice to us?

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:48.540
You are not seeing us as your good friends.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:50.460
In emergency,

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.980
only we,

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.290
the people who were once defeated by you,

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.060
know your ability best.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.910
I know your power

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:58.970
better than anyone else.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.250
That’s why I said that.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:03.190
In the competition with Chef Xie,

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:04.960
I realized the subtlety of dim sum.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.250
In the chopping competition

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.810
with Lei En,

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:09.950
I realized how important

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.160
chopping is for cooking.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.420
It was in the competitions with you

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:15.040
that I found

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:17.220
my unimaginable power.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.360
Mao.

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:23.980
What a touching speech!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.270
Okay, Lei En.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:26.730
Let's do as he said.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:27.640
We can see it as a competition

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.460
among the three of us.

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:29.730
No problem.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.750
But remember.

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:32.840
Every dish

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:33.490
should be in accordance with the theme.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.470
Chef Xie.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:35.600
The theme, right?

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:36.930
No problem.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.860
Okay. Chef Xie. Lei En.

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:40.810
Let's start.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.130
Great! They finally started!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.080
Go, Mao!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.780
The Dark Cooking Society competes with him.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:51.090
Don't you think the contrast is stark?

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.270
Yes, Chef Ruoh.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:54.990
At the Dark Cooking Society's side,

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.180
the two Chefs are assistants.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:57.860
All the procedures

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.090
unfold smoothly.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.630
And Genius Fei

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.260
is in charge of seasoning.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.650
That is to say, they are Fei's dishes.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:06.690
On the other hand,

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:07.670
at Mao's side,

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.140
Chef Xie is good at dim sum.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:10.840
Lei En is good at chopping.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.910
And Mao has a discerning palate

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.530
and creativity.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.860
Everyone has unique qualities.

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.210
And they make three kinds of dishes
according to their qualities.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.340
You are right.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.760
If Fei is a proud lone wolf

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.670
on the prairie,

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.310
then Mao and the other two chefs

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.520
are three free dragons

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.370
dancing in the sky and the sea.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:34.910
But at the same time, their spirits

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.110
associate with each other.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.710
So they are three dragons in one.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:42.550
Three dragons in one.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:10:59.550
What's wrong?

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.890
I'm okay.

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.160
You better be okay.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:19.020
Fei!

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.520
The noodles are becoming thinner.

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:33.230
They are like threads!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:34.720
This is Fei's best trick.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.330
The legendary thin noodle, the dragon whiskers noodles.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.500
The one who will stand at

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.440
the top of the Chinese Cooking Society

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.270
is me, Lan Feihong.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:46.740
I can never lose.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:48.790
I can't lose to the chef of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:50.760
Even if it's Fei.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.300
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:14.250
Good.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:24.500
Great.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.450
Time is running out.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.030
Look! Fei's group is about to finish.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.580
This is the last dish.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.170
We finished one hundred dishes.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.280
Fei's group finished.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.400
Hurry up!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.780
Time is almost up.

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.360
It's driving me crazy.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.280
What has he been doing?

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:17.660
Are those bean sprouts?

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.350
Please. We are in a competition!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.660
Why are you

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.880
still trimming bean sprouts?

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:26.190
Time is almost up.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:30.670
Be careful.

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:50.310
We finished!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.460
Time is up!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:56.980
Finally!

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.420
Just in time.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:00.910
That was close.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.910
You scared me, Mao!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.040
Now the Emperor will

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:16.600
be the judge of the competition.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.050
The Emperor will firstly

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.360
taste the one hundred dishes

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.670
of one group.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.560
The Emperor

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.250
will taste the dishes he likes.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.960
So the key to winning

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.710
is to be chosen first.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:36.050
Whichever group is chosen second is at risk.

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:39.020
But it's wasteful to only have one bite of each dish.

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:41.120
I would empty the plates.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.620
Your Majesty,

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:44.640
please have a look at the dishes of the two groups.

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.120
That is...

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.540
The Man-Han Banquet.

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:18.030
Did you hear that?

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:18.950
Fei's dish

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.020
is the famous Man-Han Banquet.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.580
I've never seen it before.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:24.900
Wow! Is that

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.810
the most luxurious royal dish in the world?

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.010
Fei is a genius indeed.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.710
You haven't seen the best part yet.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.060
Sister!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.220
They cooked the Man-Han Banquet!

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.510
The Man-Han Banquet!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:38.910
But the Emperor has had

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:41.450
the Man-Han Banquet many times.

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:42.890
He will definitely choose

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.310
Mao's dishes.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.350
Yes. He must be sick of the Man-Han Banquet.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.100
No. No.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.060
That is not the Man-Han Banquet.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.460
It looks like the Man-Han Banquet.
But it's not the Man-Han Banquet.

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:55.920
That is not the Man-Han Banquet!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:57.370
What is it?

00:15:57.990 --> 00:15:59.610
My Man-Han Banquet

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:00.830
looks like Chinese cuisine.

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:02.150
But it's not.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.620
In other words, it's the new China.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:05.950
The New China?

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:07.630
The New China?

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.510
The old Man-Han Banquet

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:15.110
is the banquet created by Manchurians

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.410
who built the Qing Dynasty

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.590
to fit in with the Han people.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.960
But in the future, China

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:24.180
will have lots of opportunities

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:26.520
to communicate with other countries.

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.710
To entertain the foreign guests,

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:30.790
we must prepare

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.010
international cuisines.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.200
Fei's new Man-Han Banquet

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:36.240
is based on

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.850
this idea.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.570
Indian curry.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:50.380
Olive oil of French and Italian cuisines.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:51.480
And ketchup.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:53.710
The Chinese cuisine of a new era

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:55.270
featuring flavors of different countries.

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:57.300
that is, the New China.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:01.590
The New China. Wow!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.050
Fei, you are amazing!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.060
What? The New China?

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:07.840
No. Fei's idea is great indeed.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.370
Your Majesty,

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.720
which side would you like to taste first?

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.550
I'll try the New China first.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:24.860
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.630
Okay. Bring Fei's dishes.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:29.970
That's not a good sign.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:30.530
You are right.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:31.560
Mao.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:32.980
Mao.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.980
He is not confined by the royal traditions

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:20.280
and can create the new Man-Han Banquet.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.070
This boy

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.910
is an amazing chef.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.310
Chef Ruoh.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:29.110
I want to taste it.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.920
Me too.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:50.680
It seems that the Emperor

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.180
really likes Fei's dishes.

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:54.620
It's hard to believe

00:18:55.060 --> 00:18:56.660
that although he only had one bite of each dish,

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:57.780
he tried all of

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.820
the one hundred dishes.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:00.130
Sister.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.030
The Emperor is stuffed.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:03.570
But he hasn't tried

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.190
our dishes.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.410
Your Majesty,

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.300
would you like to

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.560
try the other group's dishes?

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:16.040
I can't eat anymore.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:17.680
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:19.870
The Emperor won't

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:21.080
try the other group's dishes.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.330
Take them away.

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:24.000
What did you just say?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.240
Poor you.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.400
He won't even try one of your dishes.

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.180
You worked so hard

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.290
for the whole day.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:31.970
It seems that we have the winner.

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:41.460
Good job! Fei!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:42.640
No one will stop you

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.470
from becoming a royal chef.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.990
Mao and the two chefs lost to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:52.400
It's a crashing defeat.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:53.440
Mao.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.140
Your Majesty, please wait!

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:03.730
Please at least taste

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.160
this porridge.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:06.950
I cooked this porridge.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.380
Porridge?

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:09.090
Yes.

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:12.480
Stupid boy!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.780
How dare you?

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:15.300
Even a child can cook

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:16.750
this kind of stupid thing.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:17.890
How dare you let the Emperor eat it?

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.140
It's not a regular porridge.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.980
You'll see if you taste it.

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:22.250
Shut up! Boy!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.950
What is he doing?

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.240
Yeah. What is he doing?

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:27.880
After Fei's Man-Han Banquet,

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:28.560
how could he

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.390
give the Emperor a plain porridge?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.420
It's ridiculous.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.860
It seems that

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:34.990
the boy is not so great anyway.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.480
What are you trying to do this time?

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:48.810
Take this kid...

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:49.450
Majordomo Long.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:50.450
Yes.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.620
I'll have a taste.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:07.940
It's just normal porridge.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:11.660
Kick this boy out!

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:13.760
His dishes make me sick.

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:14.840
Get rid of them all!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.430
It's impossible.

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:19.530
My idea can't be wrong.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:30.300
What is going on?

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:34.280
Get off me!

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:35.570
Wait!

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:44.640
Bring that to me. I want to try it.

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:17.270
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.477 --> 00:23:22.032
Hooray! The congee from earlier is kicking in.

00:23:22.032 --> 00:23:25.252
But wait, isn't that too much?

00:23:25.958 --> 00:23:27.474
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:27.692 --> 00:23:31.713
Final Episode: Huge Reversal
Heroic Chefs of Glory

00:23:32.313 --> 00:23:33.443
It will definitely be interesting!
